+<!DOCTYPE html>
+<html lang="en">
+<head>
+  <meta charset="UTF-8">
+  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
+  <meta name="referrer" content="no-referrer">
+  <title>Privacy | The Daily Grind</title>
+  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/assets/styles.css">
+</head>
+<body>
+  <nav aria-label="Main navigation">
+    <a class="logo" href="/">THE DAILY GRIND</a>
+    <a href="/">Back to home</a>
+  </nav>
+  <main class="container policy">
+    <h1>Your privacy, by design</h1>
+    <p>Last updated: October 19, 2026</p>
+    <p>This notice describes the current Daily Grind informational website. Browsing doesn’t require personal information.</p>
+    <h2>Only what’s needed</h2>
+    <p>We don’t offer account registration, order processing, or rewards enrollment on this site. We don’t collect names, email addresses, payment details, or location information.</p>
+    <h2>No cookies or tracking</h2>
+    <p>This application doesn’t set cookies, use browser storage, run analytics, or include advertising trackers. There are no optional trackers to consent to or switch off.</p>
+    <h2>Requests and retention</h2>
+    <p>Your browser sends technical information, such as an IP address and requested page, to deliver the site. The application processes requests in memory and doesn’t create visitor logs, profiles, or a personal-data database.</p>
+    <p>The hosting provider or network infrastructure may separately process connection information. Its logging and retention settings are managed by the site operator and must be reviewed for the deployed service.</p>
+    <h2>Third-party services</h2>
+    <p>Images and styles are served from this website. Your browser doesn’t contact image providers, analytics companies, or external font services to load these pages. The coffee photograph was sourced from Unsplash and is hosted locally.</p>
+    <h2>Protecting your visit</h2>
+    <p>The application restricts external content, scripts, embedded pages, and access to device features. The production deployment must use HTTPS to protect information in transit.</p>
+    <h2>Your choices</h2>
+    <p>You can browse without creating an account or accepting tracking. There is no application-held personal profile to download or delete. If new features collect personal information, this notice and the relevant controls must be updated before those features launch.</p>
+  </main>
+  <footer><p>&copy; 2026 The Daily Grind Coffee Co.</p><a href="/">Return to home</a></footer>
+</body>
+</html>
